Good morning from Lilburn Daily! Here is what is happening around town this week. Story one: The city council approved plans for the new community garden downtown, encouraging residents to grow vegetables and flowers together. Story two: Local artisans are preparing for the annual autumn crafts fair in the park next month. Story three: The historic downtown library branch is hosting a weekend cooking workshop featuring local chefs demonstrating quick weeknight meals. Have a great week, Lilburn!
